Package: Ropenbabel
Title: Open Babel cheminformatics C++ library as an R package
Description: Provides version 3.2.1 of the Open Babel C++ library,
    built as a static library, together with its headers and data
    files. Intended for developers of other R packages (such as
    ChemmineOB) who want to link against Open Babel without requiring
    a system installation. Use Ropenbabel::pkgconfig() in Makevars.
Version: 0.99.0
License: GPL-2
Copyright: Files in src/openbabel-* are copyright the Open Babel
    authors; see src/openbabel-*/COPYING. All other files copyright
    the Ropenbabel authors.
Authors@R: c(
    person("Kevin", "Horan", role = c("aut", "cre"),
        email = "khoran@cs.ucr.edu"),
    person("Thomas", "Girke", role = "aut"),
    person("Open Babel authors", role = "cph"))
Imports: tools
LinkingTo: RcppEigen
Suggests: testthat
SystemRequirements: cmake (>= 3.12), GNU make, C++17, cairo (optional,
    for PNG output), pkg-config (optional)
biocViews: Cheminformatics, Infrastructure
URL: https://github.com/girke-lab/Ropenbabel
BugReports: https://github.com/girke-lab/Ropenbabel/issues
